      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought of this at some point as I was sleeping. I don\u0027t think it\u0027s necessarily better but it\u0027s an option that involves zero heap activity and should be safe:\n\n```\nsk_sp\u003cSkFontMgr\u003e SkFontMgr::RefEmpty() {\n    static SkNoDestructor\u003csk_sp\u003cSkFontMgr\u003e\u003e singleton([] {\n        static SkNoDestructor\u003cSkEmptyFontMgr\u003e emptyFontMgr;\n        return emptyFontMgr.get();\n    }());\n    return *singleton;\n}\n```",
